course: dictionary
lesson: 12789
title: The eightieth: ordinal numbers
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Eightieth is an ordinal number. It tells you the position of something in a line or list, and it is written 80th. The seventy-ninth comes just before it, and the eighty-first comes just after it.
explain: «My grandad is turning eightieth this year, so we are having a big party.» Here eightieth means the birthday that comes after his seventy-ninth birthday.
explain: Eightieth can also be a noun meaning one of eighty equal parts. «She ate one eightieth of the cake.» Just as a half is one of two equal parts, one eightieth is one of eighty.
fact: «Eightieth» means the one in position 80 when things are put in order. It is written 80th.
fact: As a noun, «eightieth» means one of 80 equal parts. One eightieth is written 1/80.
fact: Ordinal numbers show order: first, second, third, and so on. Eightieth is one of them.
fact: «The eightieth anniversary» means the day that is 80 years after the event happened.
fact: Eightieth is spelt e-i-g-h-t-i-e-t-h. The number 80 is eighty, and eightieth is its ordinal form.
exercise: «She finished the race in eightieth place.» Which number is the eightieth? | 18th | 8th | *80th | 800th
exercise: Which number comes just before the eightieth? | Eighty-first | *Seventy-ninth | Eighth
exercise: Which fraction is one eightieth? | 1/8 | 80/1 | 8/10 | *1/80
test: In «Grandma's eightieth birthday», what does eightieth tell us? | *Her birthday is the one that comes at number 80 | The party lasted 80 minutes | She is 18 years old | Her age is 8
test: Which is a bigger part of a pizza: one eighth or one eightieth? | Neither, they are both the same as a whole | *One eighth | One eightieth | They are the same size
exam: Tom says eightieth is written 8th. Which is the correct way to write eightieth? | 8th | 800th | *80th | 18th
